# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Maps JavaScript API, Places API New, Routes API, Street View)
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (Free, No Billing Required):
#   1. Open: https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Generate & copy your Maps Demo Key.
#   4. Copy this file to .env and paste your key below (never commit .env).
#
# Production Setup:
#   Create an API key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Street View Static/JS API.
#   Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and designated APIs:
#   https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
